Hi friends...

We are updating DIORAMA BUILDER with a new theme, "MERRY CHRISTMAS", in order to gift you at the end of 2020 and also to thank you for the support and feedbacks in our community.

And as we are listening to you there in the Community Hub, we have also included some of your suggestions for improvements and fixed some bugs, which we list below:


 Inclusion the PAN Camera control movement using the Keyboard (W, A, S, D keys);
 Changing the Mesh Display Keys from "A" and "S" to "Q" and "E";
 Inclusion the MESH color change system between "Black" and "White" using the "C" key;
 Inclusion the use of the "Z" and "X" Keys to control the camera's ZOOM;
 Implementation of the use of Steam Cloud;
 Correction of the problem that did not allow the recording of the game language when it was changed;
 Minor bugs fixes.


We want to give our players the best experience, so we will always be creating new themes and updating the game with improvements and new features.

Continue participating in our Community Hub and giving your suggestions for new themes and improvements for DIORAMA BUILDER!

Follow the Steam page of our studio to receive all the news about our games!
Go to https://store.steampowered.com/developer/virtualartsstudio and click on the FOLLOW button!
